            "review_title": "Review at Wa Japanese Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Andrew T\nHo Chi Minh47 contributions\n0\nGreat teppanaki. Very impressed that this exists in Vietnam at this high Japanese quality\nSep 2017 • Friends\nIt's hard to find great teppanaki unless you are in Japan. But alas... we heard and now found this great place in Hanoi. We had crawfish, wagyu beef and cod which was all excellent. The sashimi and tempura was high quality. Overall very authentic cuisine for still a fraction of what you pay in Big cities of course Japan.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 3, 2017",
