            "review_title": "Review at Wa Japanese Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Bondi_Phil\nBondi, Australia182 contributions\n0\nHands on with the hot pot !\nNov 2015 • Family\nI'll admit that the main reason we ate here is that it is a sister restaurant of our local favourite Japanese in Sydney. The good news is that it is at least as good ! We had the beef hot pot which I had not tried before and it was delicious. You cook all the components yourself so you can prepare to your exact preferences. The fine beef slices were so delicious they could easily have been eaten raw, but a quick dip in the pot created perfection. Service was good - polite and unobtrusive.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 20, 2015",
